  I'd want a CD-ROM drive with 512-byte block support.  The RRD43,
  RRD44, RRD45, RRD46, or one of the 512-byte compatible drives.

  I'd want a minimum of 128 megabytes, as free memory really helps
  performance -- or more, depending on what I was up to...

  I'd want a tape or backup disk device of some sort.

  I'd want the OpenVMS Alpha V7.1-2 or V7.2-1 or V7.3 release.

